{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1427291-assassin-creed-protagonists-as-scions","id":1427291,"title":"Assassin Creed Protagonists as Scions","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-12-04T12:32:56-08:00","id":1427291,"title":"Assassin Creed Protagonists as Scions","content":"To put it out there first I have played Odyssey and am currently playing Valhalla. With an upcoming Scion game in my future it got me thinking about what the protagonists would be in a Scion game.<br /> <br /> Kassandra would be kind of like Mao, a scion in potentia until adopted. The question there is who would adopt them?<br /> <br /> As for Eivor. Scion of Odin, but at the moment I am leaning towards an incarnate scion. That will probably change as I play more.<br /> <br /> Thoughts? Other protagonists?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":490,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/490-omenseer","user":"omenseer","date":". 12-04-2020, 03:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/490-omenseer","name":"omenseer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar490_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"987"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-05T07:12:47-08:00","id":1427362,"title":"","content":"Long term <b>Assassin\u2019s Creed</b> series fan, so could support some talk. Warning, my posts will clearly have spoilers for games.<br /> <br /> Let\u2019s look over last few of protagonists\u2026<br /> <br /> Viking<b> <a href=\"https://assassinscreed.fandom.com/wiki/Eivor_Varinsdottir\" target=\"_blank\">Eivor</a></b> is <i>literally</i> visited by Odin \u2013 and also impersonate him ( as Havi ) in their visions.<br /> <br /> Greek <b><a href=\"https://assassinscreed.fandom.com/wiki/Kassandra\" target=\"_blank\">Kassandra / Alexios</a></b> ( shorten <b>K/A</b> ) taken Staff of Hermes ( being his source of power ) from his hands and was chose by Poseidon to be judge of Atlantis \u2013 so I would say K/A were Chosen Scion of Hermes or Poseidon. Being all long-living and somehow sneaky across history, I would go more with the Hermes.<br /> <br /> <b><a href=\"https://assassinscreed.fandom.com/wiki/Darius\" target=\"_blank\">Darius</a></b>, \u2018first Assassin\u2019, friend of K/A, would be Scion of some Yazata god ( do not know Pantheon from get go ), as he is Persian and literally worship those gods in 5<sup>th</sup> century BCE.<br /> <br /> <b><a href=\"https://assassinscreed.fandom.com/wiki/Layla_Hassan\" target=\"_blank\">Layla Hassan</a></b> is modern Assassin that is studying Eivor and K/A lives in Animus. I would put her as Scion of Hermes ( because of staff and studying K/A ) \u2013 or Netjer god Thoth, as she is Egyptian by birth and all about discovering knowledge.<br /> <br /> And I do not have clue would <b><a href=\"https://assassinscreed.fandom.com/wiki/Desmond_Miles\" target=\"_blank\">Desmond Miles</a> </b>would be in Scion \u2013 too many lives and history he was connected. But being mostly concerned with Capitoline Three, MAYBE Jupiter?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 12-05-2020, 10:36 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-05T07:19:51-08:00","id":1427363,"title":"","content":"The idea of the modern people reliving the life of the heroes of the past has a big Scion feeling, a bit beyond the usual \u201creliving the myths\u201d but definitely Scion-esque.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-06T14:58:51-08:00","id":1427493,"title":"","content":"For Kassandra the 4 options that come to my mind is Hermes, Aries, Athena, and Poseidon.<br /> <br /> Aries and Athena aren't mentioned, but it could be argued that their presence is implied by their followers and Kassandra's choices on how much they adhere to the Spartan way of life or how much they back the Athenian way of things.. Athena would also work due to the Odyssey nature of the story.<br /> <br /> Of course there's always Aletheia.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/490-omenseer","name":"omenseer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar490_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"987"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-07T00:03:29-08:00","id":1427527,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>omenseer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1427291-assassin-creed-protagonists-as-scions?p=1427493#post1427493\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Of course there's always Aletheia.</div> </div> </div> </div>Alatheia was real world Greek myths being? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Could we get more on it, somewhere.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-07T01:17:42-08:00","id":1427532,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1427291-assassin-creed-protagonists-as-scions?p=1427527#post1427527\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Alatheia was real world Greek myths being? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Could we get more on it, somewhere.</div> </div> </div> </div>*Googles* While more often used as a concept in philosophical discourse there is mention of her as a goddess. Either a daughter of Zeus or crafted by Prometheus.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/490-omenseer","name":"omenseer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar490_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"987"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-10T01:14:14-08:00","id":1427947,"title":"","content":"Dont know if that is what people had in mind but one could use the Pantheon of Atlantis (the Theros). They are after all more less what the Isu are in assasins creed.<br /> <br /> Kassandra would also work as an adopted Scion of Zeus. He is afterall an ancestor of her.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26520-mugbearer23","name":"Mugbearer23","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}